      "content": "you keep saying the same thing but it doesn't change the truth. i'm fundamentally broken in their eyes. once you've been cast out like this, you're just a burden that people have to pretend doesn't exist. honestly, it feels like the world is just moving on without me, and maybe that's just how it's supposed to be. if i'm already socially dead, what's even the point of pretending i'm still part of the living?",
